PartialFillSettler_totalDstCstEscrowed
├── when no fills have been recorded for orderDigest
│   └── it should return zero
├── when fills have been recorded and no finalisations
│   └── it should return the sum of f.dstCstProduced across eligible fillers
└── when some fillers have been finalised or refunded
    └── it should return the sum decremented by the settled and refunded amounts
